[
  {
    "content_id": "10025001001",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 1:1",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25001001",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>1</sup>&nbsp;先前满有人民的城， 现在何竟独坐！ 先前在列国中为大的， 现在竟如寡妇； 先前在诸省中为王后的， 现在成为进贡的。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025001002",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 1:2",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25001002",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>2</sup>&nbsp;她夜间痛哭，泪流满腮； 在一切所亲爱的中间没有一个安慰她的。 她的朋友都以诡诈待她， 成为她的仇敌。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025001003",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 1:3",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25001003",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>3</sup>&nbsp;犹大因遭遇苦难， 又因多服劳苦就迁到外邦。 她住在列国中，寻不着安息； 追逼她的都在狭窄之地将她追上。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025001004",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 1:4",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25001004",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>4</sup>&nbsp;锡安的路径因无人来守圣节就悲伤； 她的城门凄凉； 她的祭司叹息； 她的处女受艰难，自己也愁苦。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025001005",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 1:5",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25001005",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>5</sup>&nbsp;她的敌人为首； 她的仇敌亨通； 因耶和华为她许多的罪过使她受苦； 她的孩童被敌人掳去。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025001006",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 1:6",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25001006",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>6</sup>&nbsp;锡安城的威荣全都失去。 她的首领像找不着草场的鹿； 在追赶的人前无力行走。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025001007",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 1:7",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25001007",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>7</sup>&nbsp;耶路撒冷在困苦窘迫之时， 就追想古时一切的乐境。 她百姓落在敌人手中，无人救济； 敌人看见，就因她的荒凉嗤笑。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025001008",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 1:8",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25001008",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>8</sup>&nbsp;耶路撒冷大大犯罪， 所以成为不洁之物； 素来尊敬她的，见她赤露就都藐视她； 她自己也叹息退后。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025001009",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 1:9",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25001009",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>9</sup>&nbsp;她的污秽是在衣襟上； 她不思想自己的结局， 所以非常地败落， 无人安慰她。 她说：耶和华啊，求你看我的苦难， 因为仇敌夸大。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025001010",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 1:10",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25001010",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>10</sup>&nbsp;敌人伸手，夺取她的美物； 她眼见外邦人进入她的圣所— 论这外邦人，你曾吩咐不可入你的会中。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025001011",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 1:11",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25001011",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>11</sup>&nbsp;她的民都叹息，寻求食物； 他们用美物换粮食，要救性命。 他们说：耶和华啊，求你观看， 因为我甚是卑贱。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025001012",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 1:12",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25001012",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>12</sup>&nbsp;你们一切过路的人哪，这事你们不介意吗？ 你们要观看： 有像这临到我的痛苦没有— 就是耶和华在他发烈怒的日子使我所受的苦？</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025001013",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 1:13",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25001013",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>13</sup>&nbsp;他从高天使火进入我的骨头， 克制了我； 他铺下网罗，绊我的脚， 使我转回； 他使我终日凄凉发昏。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025001014",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 1:14",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25001014",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>14</sup>&nbsp;我罪过的轭是他手所绑的， 犹如轭绳缚在我颈项上； 他使我的力量衰败。 主将我交在我所不能敌挡的人手中。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025001015",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 1:15",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25001015",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>15</sup>&nbsp;主轻弃我中间的一切勇士， 招聚多人攻击我， 要压碎我的少年人。 主将犹大居民踹下， 像在酒榨中一样。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025001016",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 1:16",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25001016",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>16</sup>&nbsp;我因这些事哭泣； 我眼泪汪汪； 因为那当安慰我、救我性命的， 离我甚远。 我的儿女孤苦， 因为仇敌得了胜。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025001017",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 1:17",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25001017",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>17</sup>&nbsp;锡安举手，无人安慰。 耶和华论雅各已经出令， 使四围的人作他仇敌； 耶路撒冷在他们中间像不洁之物。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025001018",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 1:18",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25001018",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>18</sup>&nbsp;耶和华是公义的！ 他这样待我，是因我违背他的命令。 众民哪，请听我的话， 看我的痛苦； 我的处女和少年人都被掳去。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025001019",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 1:19",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25001019",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>19</sup>&nbsp;我招呼我所亲爱的， 他们却愚弄我。 我的祭司和长老正寻求食物、救性命的时候， 就在城中绝气。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025001020",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 1:20",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25001020",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>20</sup>&nbsp;耶和华啊，求你观看， 因为我在急难中。 我心肠扰乱； 我心在我里面翻转， 因我大大悖逆。 在外，刀剑使人丧子； 在家，犹如死亡。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025001021",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 1:21",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25001021",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>21</sup>&nbsp;听见我叹息的有人； 安慰我的却无人！ 我的仇敌都听见我所遭的患难； 因你做这事，他们都喜乐。 你必使你报告的日子来到， 他们就像我一样。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025001022",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 1:22",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25001022",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>22</sup>&nbsp;愿他们的恶行都呈在你面前； 你怎样因我的一切罪过待我， 求你照样待他们； 因我叹息甚多，心中发昏。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025002001",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 2:1",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25002001",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>1</sup>&nbsp;主何竟发怒，使黑云遮蔽锡安城！ 他将以色列的华美从天扔在地上； 在他发怒的日子并不记念自己的脚凳。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025002002",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 2:2",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25002002",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>2</sup>&nbsp;主吞灭雅各一切的住处，并不顾惜。 他发怒倾覆犹大民的保障， 使这保障坍倒在地； 他辱没这国和其中的首领。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025002003",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 2:3",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25002003",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>3</sup>&nbsp;他发烈怒，把以色列的角全然砍断， 在仇敌面前收回右手。 他像火焰四围吞灭，将雅各烧毁。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025002004",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 2:4",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25002004",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>4</sup>&nbsp;他张弓好像仇敌； 他站着举起右手， 如同敌人将悦人眼目的，尽行杀戮。 在锡安百姓的帐棚上 倒出他的忿怒，像火一样。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025002005",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 2:5",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25002005",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>5</sup>&nbsp;主如仇敌吞灭以色列和锡安的一切宫殿， 拆毁百姓的保障； 在犹大民中加增悲伤哭号。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025002006",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 2:6",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25002006",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>6</sup>&nbsp;他强取自己的帐幕，好像是园中的窝棚， 毁坏他的聚会之处。 耶和华使圣节和安息日在锡安都被忘记， 又在怒气的愤恨中藐视君王和祭司。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025002007",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 2:7",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25002007",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>7</sup>&nbsp;耶和华丢弃自己的祭坛， 憎恶自己的圣所， 将宫殿的墙垣交付仇敌。 他们在耶和华的殿中喧嚷， 像在圣会之日一样。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025002008",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 2:8",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25002008",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>8</sup>&nbsp;耶和华定意拆毁锡安的城墙； 他拉了准绳， 不将手收回，定要毁灭。 他使外郭和城墙都悲哀， 一同衰败。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025002009",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 2:9",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25002009",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>9</sup>&nbsp;锡安的门都陷入地内； 主将她的门闩毁坏，折断。 她的君王和首领落在没有律法的列国中； 她的先知不得见耶和华的异象。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025002010",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 2:10",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25002010",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>10</sup>&nbsp;锡安城的长老坐在地上默默无声； 他们扬起尘土落在头上，腰束麻布； 耶路撒冷的处女垂头至地。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025002011",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 2:11",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25002011",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>11</sup>&nbsp;我眼中流泪，以致失明； 我的心肠扰乱，肝胆涂地， 都因我众民遭毁灭， 又因孩童和吃奶的在城内街上发昏。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025002012",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 2:12",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25002012",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>12</sup>&nbsp;那时，他们在城内街上发昏，好像受伤的， 在母亲的怀里，将要丧命； 对母亲说：谷、酒在哪里呢？</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025002013",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 2:13",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25002013",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>13</sup>&nbsp;耶路撒冷的民哪，我可用什么向你证明呢？ 我可用什么与你相比呢？ 锡安的民哪，我可拿什么和你比较，好安慰你呢？ 因为你的裂口大如海， 谁能医治你呢？</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025002014",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 2:14",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25002014",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>14</sup>&nbsp;你的先知为你见虚假和愚昧的异象， 并没有显露你的罪孽， 使你被掳的归回； 却为你见虚假的默示 和使你被赶出本境的缘故。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025002015",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 2:15",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25002015",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>15</sup>&nbsp;凡过路的都向你拍掌。 他们向耶路撒冷城嗤笑，摇头，说： 难道人所称为全美的， 称为全地所喜悦的，就是这城吗？</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025002016",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 2:16",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25002016",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>16</sup>&nbsp;你的仇敌都向你大大张口； 他们嗤笑，又切齿说： 我们吞灭她。 这真是我们所盼望的日子临到了！ 我们亲眼看见了！</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025002017",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 2:17",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25002017",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>17</sup>&nbsp;耶和华成就了他所定的， 应验了他古时所命定的。 他倾覆了，并不顾惜， 使你的仇敌向你夸耀； 使你敌人的角也被高举。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025002018",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 2:18",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25002018",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>18</sup>&nbsp;锡安民的心哀求主。 锡安的城墙啊，愿你流泪如河， 昼夜不息； 愿你眼中的瞳人泪流不止。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025002019",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 2:19",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25002019",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>19</sup>&nbsp;夜间，每逢交更的时候要起来呼喊， 在主面前倾心如水。 你的孩童在各市口上受饿发昏； 你要为他们的性命向主举手祷告。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025002020",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 2:20",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25002020",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>20</sup>&nbsp;耶和华啊，求你观看！ 见你向谁这样行？ 妇人岂可吃自己所生育手里所摇弄的婴孩吗？ 祭司和先知岂可在主的圣所中被杀戮吗？</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025002021",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 2:21",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25002021",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>21</sup>&nbsp;少年人和老年人都在街上躺卧； 我的处女和壮丁都倒在刀下； 你发怒的日子杀死他们。 你杀了，并不顾惜。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025002022",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 2:22",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25002022",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>22</sup>&nbsp;你招聚四围惊吓我的， 像在大会的日子招聚人一样。 耶和华发怒的日子， 无人逃脱，无人存留。 我所摇弄所养育的婴孩， 仇敌都杀净了。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025003001",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 3:1",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25003001",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>1</sup>&nbsp;我是因耶和华忿怒的杖， 遭遇困苦的人。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025003002",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 3:2",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25003002",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>2</sup>&nbsp;他引导我，使我行在黑暗中， 不行在光明里。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025003003",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 3:3",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25003003",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>3</sup>&nbsp;他真是终日再三反手攻击我。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025003004",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 3:4",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25003004",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>4</sup>&nbsp;他使我的皮肉枯干； 他折断我的骨头。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025003005",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 3:5",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25003005",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>5</sup>&nbsp;他筑垒攻击我， 用苦楚和艰难围困我。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025003006",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 3:6",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25003006",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>6</sup>&nbsp;他使我住在幽暗之处， 像死了许久的人一样。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025003007",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 3:7",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25003007",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>7</sup>&nbsp;他用篱笆围住我，使我不能出去； 他使我的铜链沉重。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025003008",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 3:8",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25003008",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>8</sup>&nbsp;我哀号求救； 他使我的祷告不得上达。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025003009",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 3:9",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25003009",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>9</sup>&nbsp;他用凿过的石头挡住我的道； 他使我的路弯曲。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025003010",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 3:10",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25003010",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>10</sup>&nbsp;他向我如熊埋伏， 如狮子在隐密处。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025003011",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 3:11",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25003011",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>11</sup>&nbsp;他使我转离正路， 将我撕碎，使我凄凉。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025003012",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 3:12",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25003012",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>12</sup>&nbsp;他张弓将我当作箭靶子。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025003013",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 3:13",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25003013",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>13</sup>&nbsp;他把箭袋中的箭射入我的肺腑。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025003014",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 3:14",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25003014",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>14</sup>&nbsp;我成了众民的笑话； 他们终日以我为歌曲。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025003015",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 3:15",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25003015",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>15</sup>&nbsp;他用苦楚充满我，使我饱用茵 。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025003016",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 3:16",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25003016",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>16</sup>&nbsp;他又用沙石碜断我的牙， 用灰尘将我蒙蔽。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025003017",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 3:17",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25003017",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>17</sup>&nbsp;你使我远离平安， 我忘记好处。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025003018",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 3:18",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25003018",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>18</sup>&nbsp;我就说：我的力量衰败； 我在耶和华那里毫无指望！</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025003019",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 3:19",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25003019",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>19</sup>&nbsp;耶和华啊，求你记念我 如茵 和苦胆的困苦窘迫。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025003020",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 3:20",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25003020",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>20</sup>&nbsp;我心想念这些， 就在里面忧闷。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025003021",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 3:21",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25003021",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>21</sup>&nbsp;我想起这事， 心里就有指望。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025003022",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 3:22",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25003022",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>22</sup>&nbsp;我们不致消灭， 是出于耶和华诸般的慈爱； 是因他的怜悯不致断绝。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025003023",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 3:23",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25003023",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>23</sup>&nbsp;每早晨，这都是新的； 你的诚实极其广大！</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025003024",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 3:24",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25003024",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>24</sup>&nbsp;我心里说：耶和华是我的分， 因此，我要仰望他。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025003025",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 3:25",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25003025",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>25</sup>&nbsp;凡等候耶和华，心里寻求他的， 耶和华必施恩给他。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025003026",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 3:26",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25003026",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>26</sup>&nbsp;人仰望耶和华， 静默等候他的救恩， 这原是好的。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025003027",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 3:27",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25003027",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>27</sup>&nbsp;人在幼年负轭， 这原是好的。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025003028",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 3:28",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25003028",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>28</sup>&nbsp;他当独坐无言， 因为这是耶和华加在他身上的。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025003029",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 3:29",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25003029",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>29</sup>&nbsp;他当口贴尘埃， 或者有指望。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025003030",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 3:30",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25003030",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>30</sup>&nbsp;他当由人打他的腮颊， 要满受凌辱。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025003031",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 3:31",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25003031",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>31</sup>&nbsp;因为主必不永远丢弃人。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025003032",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 3:32",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25003032",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>32</sup>&nbsp;主虽使人忧愁， 还要照他诸般的慈爱发怜悯。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025003033",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 3:33",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25003033",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>33</sup>&nbsp;因他并不甘心使人受苦， 使人忧愁。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025003034",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 3:34",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25003034",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>34</sup>&nbsp;人将世上被囚的踹在脚下，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025003035",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 3:35",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25003035",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>35</sup>&nbsp;或在至高者面前屈枉人，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025003036",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 3:36",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25003036",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>36</sup>&nbsp;或在人的讼事上颠倒是非， 这都是主看不上的。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025003037",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 3:37",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25003037",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>37</sup>&nbsp;除非主命定， 谁能说成就成呢？</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025003038",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 3:38",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25003038",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>38</sup>&nbsp;祸福不都出于至高者的口吗？</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025003039",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 3:39",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25003039",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>39</sup>&nbsp;活人因自己的罪受罚， 为何发怨言呢？</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025003040",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 3:40",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25003040",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>40</sup>&nbsp;我们当深深考察自己的行为， 再归向耶和华。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025003041",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 3:41",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25003041",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>41</sup>&nbsp;我们当诚心向天上的　神举手祷告。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025003042",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 3:42",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25003042",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>42</sup>&nbsp;我们犯罪背逆， 你并不赦免。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025003043",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 3:43",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25003043",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>43</sup>&nbsp;你自被怒气遮蔽，追赶我们； 你施行杀戮，并不顾惜。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025003044",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 3:44",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25003044",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>44</sup>&nbsp;你以黑云遮蔽自己， 以致祷告不得透入。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025003045",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 3:45",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25003045",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>45</sup>&nbsp;你使我们在万民中成为污秽和渣滓。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025003046",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 3:46",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25003046",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>46</sup>&nbsp;我们的仇敌都向我们大大张口。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025003047",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 3:47",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25003047",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>47</sup>&nbsp;恐惧和陷坑，残害和毁灭， 都临近我们。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025003048",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 3:48",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25003048",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>48</sup>&nbsp;因我众民遭的毁灭， 我就眼泪下流如河。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025003049",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 3:49",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25003049",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>49</sup>&nbsp;我的眼多多流泪， 总不止息，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025003050",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 3:50",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25003050",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>50</sup>&nbsp;直等耶和华垂顾， 从天观看。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025003051",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 3:51",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25003051",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>51</sup>&nbsp;因我本城的众民， 我的眼，使我的心伤痛。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025003052",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 3:52",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25003052",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>52</sup>&nbsp;无故与我为仇的追逼我， 像追雀鸟一样。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025003053",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 3:53",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25003053",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>53</sup>&nbsp;他们使我的命在牢狱中断绝， 并将一块石头抛在我身上。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025003054",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 3:54",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25003054",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>54</sup>&nbsp;众水流过我头， 我说：我命断绝了！</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025003055",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 3:55",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25003055",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>55</sup>&nbsp;耶和华啊， 我从深牢中求告你的名。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025003056",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 3:56",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25003056",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>56</sup>&nbsp;你曾听见我的声音； 我求你解救， 你不要掩耳不听。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025003057",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 3:57",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25003057",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>57</sup>&nbsp;我求告你的日子，你临近我， 说：不要惧怕！</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025003058",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 3:58",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25003058",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>58</sup>&nbsp;主啊，你伸明了我的冤； 你救赎了我的命。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025003059",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 3:59",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25003059",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>59</sup>&nbsp;耶和华啊，你见了我受的委屈； 求你为我伸冤。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025003060",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 3:60",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25003060",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>60</sup>&nbsp;他们仇恨我，谋害我， 你都看见了。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025003061",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 3:61",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25003061",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>61</sup>&nbsp;耶和华啊，你听见他们辱骂我的话， 知道他们向我所设的计，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025003062",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 3:62",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25003062",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>62</sup>&nbsp;并那些起来攻击我的人口中所说的话， 以及终日向我所设的计谋。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025003063",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 3:63",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25003063",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>63</sup>&nbsp;求你观看， 他们坐下，起来，都以我为歌曲。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025003064",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 3:64",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25003064",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>64</sup>&nbsp;耶和华啊，你要按着他们手所做的 向他们施行报应。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025003065",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 3:65",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25003065",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>65</sup>&nbsp;你要使他们心里刚硬， 使你的咒诅临到他们。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025003066",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 3:66",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25003066",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>66</sup>&nbsp;你要发怒追赶他们， 从耶和华的天下除灭他们。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025004001",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 4:1",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25004001",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>1</sup>&nbsp;黄金何其失光！ 纯金何其变色！ 圣所的石头倒在各市口上。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025004002",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 4:2",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25004002",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>2</sup>&nbsp;锡安宝贵的众子好比精金， 现在何竟算为窑匠手所做的瓦瓶？</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025004003",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 4:3",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25004003",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>3</sup>&nbsp;野狗尚且把奶乳哺其子， 我民的妇人倒成为残忍， 好像旷野的鸵鸟一般。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025004004",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 4:4",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25004004",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>4</sup>&nbsp;吃奶孩子的舌头因干渴贴住上膛； 孩童求饼，无人擘给他们。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025004005",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 4:5",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25004005",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>5</sup>&nbsp;素来吃美好食物的， 现今在街上变为孤寒； 素来卧朱红褥子的， 现今躺卧粪堆。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025004006",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 4:6",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25004006",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>6</sup>&nbsp;都因我众民的罪孽比所多玛的罪还大； 所多玛虽然无人加手于她， 还是转眼之间被倾覆。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025004007",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 4:7",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25004007",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>7</sup>&nbsp;锡安的贵胄素来比雪纯净， 比奶更白； 他们的身体比红宝玉更红， 像光润的蓝宝石一样。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025004008",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 4:8",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25004008",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>8</sup>&nbsp;现在他们的面貌比煤炭更黑， 以致在街上无人认识； 他们的皮肤紧贴骨头， 枯干如同槁木。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025004009",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 4:9",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25004009",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>9</sup>&nbsp;饿死的不如被刀杀的， 因为这是缺了田间的土产， 就身体衰弱，渐渐消灭。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025004010",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 4:10",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25004010",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>10</sup>&nbsp;慈心的妇人，当我众民被毁灭的时候， 亲手煮自己的儿女作为食物。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025004011",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 4:11",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25004011",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>11</sup>&nbsp;耶和华发怒成就他所定的， 倒出他的烈怒； 在锡安使火着起， 烧毁锡安的根基。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025004012",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 4:12",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25004012",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>12</sup>&nbsp;地上的君王和世上的居民都不信 敌人和仇敌能进耶路撒冷的城门。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025004013",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 4:13",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25004013",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>13</sup>&nbsp;这都因她先知的罪恶和祭司的罪孽； 他们在城中流了义人的血。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025004014",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 4:14",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25004014",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>14</sup>&nbsp;他们在街上如瞎子乱走， 又被血玷污， 以致人不能摸他们的衣服。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025004015",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 4:15",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25004015",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>15</sup>&nbsp;人向他们喊着说： 不洁净的，躲开，躲开！ 不要挨近我！ 他们逃走飘流的时候， 列国中有人说： 他们不可仍在这里寄居。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025004016",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 4:16",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25004016",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>16</sup>&nbsp;耶和华发怒，将他们分散， 不再眷顾他们； 人不重看祭司，也不厚待长老。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025004017",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 4:17",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25004017",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>17</sup>&nbsp;我们仰望人来帮助， 以致眼目失明，还是枉然； 我们所盼望的，竟盼望一个不能救人的国！</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025004018",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 4:18",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25004018",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>18</sup>&nbsp;仇敌追赶我们的脚步像打猎的， 以致我们不敢在自己的街上行走。 我们的结局临近； 我们的日子满足； 我们的结局来到了。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025004019",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 4:19",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25004019",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>19</sup>&nbsp;追赶我们的比空中的鹰更快； 他们在山上追逼我们， 在旷野埋伏，等候我们。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025004020",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 4:20",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25004020",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>20</sup>&nbsp;耶和华的受膏者好比我们鼻中的气， 在他们的坑中被捉住； 我们曾论到他说： 我们必在他荫下， 在列国中存活。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025004021",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 4:21",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25004021",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>21</sup>&nbsp;住乌斯地的以东民哪，只管欢喜快乐； 苦杯也必传到你那里； 你必喝醉，以致露体。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025004022",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 4:22",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25004022",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>22</sup>&nbsp;锡安的民哪，你罪孽的刑罚受足了， 耶和华必不使你再被掳去。 以东的民哪，他必追讨你的罪孽， 显露你的罪恶。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025005001",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 5:1",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25005001",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>1</sup>&nbsp;耶和华啊，求你记念我们所遭遇的事， 观看我们所受的凌辱。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025005002",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 5:2",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25005002",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>2</sup>&nbsp;我们的产业归与外邦人； 我们的房屋归与外路人。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025005003",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 5:3",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25005003",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>3</sup>&nbsp;我们是无父的孤儿； 我们的母亲好像寡妇。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025005004",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 5:4",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25005004",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>4</sup>&nbsp;我们出钱才得水喝； 我们的柴是人卖给我们的。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025005005",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 5:5",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25005005",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>5</sup>&nbsp;追赶我们的，到了我们的颈项上； 我们疲乏不得歇息。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025005006",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 5:6",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25005006",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>6</sup>&nbsp;我们投降埃及人和亚述人， 为要得粮吃饱。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025005007",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 5:7",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25005007",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>7</sup>&nbsp;我们列祖犯罪，而今不在了； 我们担当他们的罪孽。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025005008",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 5:8",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25005008",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>8</sup>&nbsp;奴仆辖制我们， 无人救我们脱离他们的手。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025005009",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 5:9",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25005009",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>9</sup>&nbsp;因为旷野的刀剑， 我们冒着险才得粮食。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025005010",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 5:10",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25005010",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>10</sup>&nbsp;因饥饿燥热， 我们的皮肤就黑如炉。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025005011",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 5:11",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25005011",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>11</sup>&nbsp;敌人在锡安玷污妇人， 在犹大的城邑玷污处女。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025005012",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 5:12",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25005012",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>12</sup>&nbsp;他们吊起首领的手， 也不尊敬老人的面。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025005013",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 5:13",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25005013",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>13</sup>&nbsp;少年人扛磨石， 孩童背木柴，都绊跌了。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025005014",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 5:14",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25005014",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>14</sup>&nbsp;老年人在城门口断绝； 少年人不再作乐。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025005015",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 5:15",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25005015",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>15</sup>&nbsp;我们心中的快乐止息， 跳舞变为悲哀。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025005016",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 5:16",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25005016",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>16</sup>&nbsp;冠冕从我们的头上落下； 我们犯罪了，我们有祸了！</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025005017",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 5:17",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25005017",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>17</sup>&nbsp;这些事我们心里发昏， 我们的眼睛昏花。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025005018",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 5:18",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25005018",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>18</sup>&nbsp;锡安山荒凉， 野狗行在其上。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025005019",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 5:19",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25005019",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>19</sup>&nbsp;耶和华啊，你存到永远； 你的宝座存到万代。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025005020",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 5:20",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25005020",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>20</sup>&nbsp;你为何永远忘记我们？ 为何许久离弃我们？</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025005021",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 5:21",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25005021",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>21</sup>&nbsp;耶和华啊，求你使我们向你回转， 我们便得回转。 求你复新我们的日子，像古时一样。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025005022",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 5:22",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25005022",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>22</sup>&nbsp;你竟全然弃绝我们， 向我们大发烈怒？</p>"
  }
]